<title>USA: New York grain freight fixtures - Nov 13.</title>
<headline>New York grain freight fixtures - Nov 13.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>TBM 52,000 tons hss USG/Japan end-Nov/early Dec no combo $25.25 Dreyfus.</p>
<p>Despina 52,000 tonnes hss USG/Japan 20-25/11 $26.00 no combo 11 days MSK (adds vessel name, amends).</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
